<title>FINLAND: Merita sells property for FIM 100 mln.</title>
<headline>Merita sells property for FIM 100 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's largest banking group Merita Oy said in a statement it had on Wednesday sold a building under construction for almost 100 million markka to municipal pension institution  Kuntien Elakevakuutus.</p>
<p>&quot;This is a high-class, about 7,700 square metre office building which has been completely rented out at long-term leases. The price ... is almost 100 million markka,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
</text>
